From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Milan Zamazal <mzamazal@redhat.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 19:40:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 03/14] ipa: ipu3: Move non-specific parts of Af to libipa

Some parts of the ipu3 autofocus algorithm could be reused by other
pipelines, most notably softisp.  Let's move the parts of the algorithm
that are not specific to the IPU3 hardware to libipa and use them from
there in ipu3.

Signed-off-by: Milan Zamazal <mzamazal@redhat.com>
